  "description": "既存コードのリファクタリング候補の発見（scout）→類似実装の統合設計（unify）→挙動保存の適用（apply）を一貫して支援し、加えてテストコードのリファクタリング（test-refactor）も担うプラグイン",
  "agents": [
    "./agents/refactor-scan-architecture.md",
    "./agents/refactor-scan-locality.md",
    "./agents/refactor-scan-drift.md",
    "./agents/refactor-divergence-mapper.md",
    "./agents/refactor-implementer.md",
    "./agents/test-refactor-baseline-runner.md",
    "./agents/test-refactor-surveyor.md",
    "./agents/test-refactor-cross-analyzer.md",
    "./agents/test-refactor-implementer.md"
  ]
}
